        "title": "Time Frames are Fractal",
        "content": "A small swing that you ignore on the daily chart can be a real structure on the 1-hour chart.\n\nThe market looks the same at every size, so you can go down to a lower time frame and find the same pattern again. But always remember what the higher time frame says.\n\n*How to avoid the mistake:* first learn exactly what a swing is (Section 4), then the rules that make it structural (Sections 5 and 8)."
