        "content": "Three candles beside three candles is only the bare minimum. Ideally you want something in between them, to be sure it is a proper swing. A swing with nothing between is weaker.\n\nYou also want some distance in price, because otherwise you are only in a consolidation phase, and it is very hard to find swing highs and lows there.\n\nDo not zoom the chart in until a small move looks big. The host jokes that anything can be made to look big, and Roman says this is \"cheating\"."
