    "content": "### Your Homework\n1. Open a chart and turn on the replay mode.\n2. Pick one chart and block out one or two hours.\n3. Mark every structural swing high and swing low with the rules from this chapter. Draw the red line for each one.\n4. Take no trades. You are only training your eyes.\n5. Later, go back and check your marks for mistakes. Roman still found mistakes after 10 hours.\n6. Share your charts and ask if you found the highs and lows correctly.\n\n### Next Week\nIt is a direct continuation: **market structure**.\nYou will learn how to see when price breaks out and it may be a break of structure to the bullish side or to the bearish side. It is not as simple as it looks. There are many new terms and many new cases.\n\n### Community\nThe team will open a Discord channel for the Smart Money concept. They ask you to do the test and share your charts so that people can discuss and help each other. If you do not know how to join, look for the purple Discord button at the top right of the stream page, or use the link on their website.\n\nThe team may share drawing templates (their set of lines and boxes) in the future. It needs some work from the developer, and they asked viewers to say if they are interested.\n\n**Their reminder one more time: do not start trading yet. First, learn.**"
